{"id":231,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"坐禅と人間教育で育む市川の学び","feature_description":"市川高等学校は、崇高な精神、健康な身体、互いの敬愛、円満な人格を校訓に掲げています。毎週の坐禅や禅堂での錬成を通して、生活全般にわたる規律と禅の精神を体得し、沈着冷静で信念のある人間を育てる方針が、学校紹介の中で明確に示されています。感謝の念を養う人間教育が柱で、日常の作法まで教育に含めています。独自のコース紹介や学校生活の導線も確認できます。","clubs":[{"id":5003,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5004,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5005,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5006,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5007,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5008,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5009,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5010,"name":"相撲部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5011,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5012,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5013,"name":"情報メディア部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5014,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5015,"name":"茶華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5016,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5017,"name":"ダンス同好会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ichikawa.ed.jp